  "title": "Chicken Macaroni Salad",
  "description": "Toss cooked macaroni with a simple mix of chicken, corn, peas, carrots, shredded lettuce, mayonnaise and dried basil for a colorfully delicious chilled salad.",
  "authors": [
    "purple"
  ],
